data: {"id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436-thinking-parallel_evidence-151", "run_id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，我需要先确认 Pod 的当前状态和事件，然后基于 Prometheus 已采集的事实（Pending 阶段、waiting_reason=ContainerCreating、无重启、无日志、无 Tracing）来设计后续的 Kubernetes 描述性查询和 YAML 检查。\n\n按计划执行：\n1. `kubectl_describe` 获取详细事件\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml` 获取 Pod 完整 spec（检查 volumes、runtimeClass 等）\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788435071972, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

