data: {"id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436-thinking-parallel_evidence-899", "run_id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 生命周期确认**：Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 当前 `phase=Pending`，`containerStatuses.app.reason=ContainerCreating`，`restarts=0`。调度成功（`PodScheduled=True`），节点为 `node2`。Prometheus 指标印证：`kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`、`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}=1`。\n\n2. **关键事件**：`kubectl_describe` 返回核心事实——Pod 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` 要求 Multus CNI 使用名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definition`（NAD）。该 N", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788435090245, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

