data: {"id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436-final", "run_id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436", "seq": 904, "ts_ms": 1788435109074, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v in aiops-case-05 stuck in ContainerCreating (Pending) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` (container: app) | 确认 Pod 处于等待状态，容器未启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (46 条，最近 2s) | 持续报错表明指定的网络定义缺失，导致网络插件失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add)` (512 over 116m) | 确认根本机制是 Multus 插件因找不到 NAD 导致 Pod 沙箱创建失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container: app, reason: ContainerCreating) = 1 (`sample_count`: 1, `trend_evaluable`: false) | 量化验证容器当前停留在等待阶段 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件 (`fact-12c012a4dbaa`, `fact-01d7eb3fbc8c`) 与容器状态 (`fact-17a945ccf8cc`) 互相印证。Pod 因引用的 Multus `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` (\"unavailable-network\") 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在，无法配置网络，直接导致 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，进而使容器长期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用缺失的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' (g1:fact-01d7eb3fbc8c) → Multus CNI 插件查找失败 (g1:fact-12c012a4dbaa) → 创建 Pod 沙箱失败 (g1:fact-12c012a4dbaa) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 (g1:fact-17a945ccf8cc)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 声明了一个不存在的 Multus `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` (`unavailable-network`)。\n\n- **原因**：Pod 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` (NAD)（证据见 `fact-01d7eb3fbc8c`, `fact-12c012a4dbaa`）。\n- **机制**：Multus CNI 插件尝试加载该网络配置，但 API 返回 \"not found\" 错误，导致无法为 Pod 配置底层网络接口。\n- **现象**：由于网络配置失败，kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱 (`FailedCreatePodSandBox`)，导致容器持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据见 `fact-17a945ccf8cc`, `fact-74f2aad4be71`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 536.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 536.6s (Evidence 529.3s, RCA 7.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 562.719, "metrics": {"run_id": "9b9429e0d1ee4436", "mttr": {"value": "9.4m", "seconds": 562.7261714935303, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 562726.1714935303, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 552192.4397945404, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14008.270263671875, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9989.054441452026}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14651.767253875732, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 536598.709821701, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11437.456369400024, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

